-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To changes its category; order arrows arrange category entries. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To changes its category; order arrows arrange category entries. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "选择一个分类并搜索条件。“隐藏”会将其从选择器中移除，但不删除其定义。“切换条件”控制它能否用于自动切换循环。“移动到”会更改其分类；排序箭头可调整分类中各项的顺序。自定义条件可以编辑、复制或删除。"
-- en: "Choose a current profile or enter a new profile name and create it. Copy replaces the current profile’s settings; Reset restores defaults. Delete removes another saved profile. Copy, Reset and Delete ask for confirmation."
L["Choose a current profile or enter a new profile name and create it. Copy replaces the current profile’s settings; Reset restores defaults. Delete removes another saved profile. Copy, Reset and Delete ask for confirmation."] = "选择一个当前配置文件，或输入新的配置文件名称并创建。“从配置文件复制”会替换当前配置文件的设置；“重置”会恢复默认值。“删除”会移除另一个已保存的配置文件。“从配置文件复制”“重置”和“删除”都会要求确认。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; Remove binding unlinks it. Reset restores a packaged set. Import replaces its item list."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; Remove binding unlinks it. Reset restores a packaged set. Import replaces its item list."] = "选择一个物品组并编辑其优先级列表。“全局”会在所有配置文件间共享该物品组。移动箭头可更改物品优先级。“绑定物品组”会拾取一件可用物品以放置到动作条上；“移除绑定”会解除其关联。“重置”会恢复内置的物品组。“导入”会替换其物品列表。"
