L["Drag the title bar to move. Set Scale with the top-left slider; child windows follow it. The question mark toggles Help. Close with X, Escape, or right-click in the content area."] = "拖动标题栏可移动窗口。使用左上角的滑块设置缩放；子窗口会随之缩放。问号按钮可开关帮助。可通过 X、Esc 键或在内容区域右键点击来关闭。"
-- en: "Edit the description, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."
L["Edit the description, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "编辑描述、作者、服务器、电子邮件、网站和版本。来源引用与你的署名分开保存。“使用更改”会更新循环草稿；应用循环以保存。“取消”或 Esc 键会恢复此对话框打开时的值。"
-- en: "Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; where the client has spell ranks, Use this exact spell rank limits matching to the rank you chose. Enabled toggles the announcement. Add announcement creates a new entry after an action is selected."
L["Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; where the client has spell ranks, Use this exact spell rank limits matching to the rank you chose. Enabled toggles the announcement. Add announcement creates a new entry after an action is selected."] = "展开一条通报以选择其动作、事件、频道和文本。法术字段会搜索法术目录；在有法术等级的客户端上，“使用这个确切的法术等级”会将匹配限制为你选择的等级。“已启用”用于开关该通报。选择动作后，“添加通报”会创建一个新条目。"
