L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Import replaces the selected effect after validation."] = "选择一个效果以编辑其名称、类型及该类型特有的设置。图标会实时预览效果。序列部分按顺序编辑动画、颜色、脉冲或自定义帧。“复制”会创建一个独立的效果。“导入”会在验证后替换所选效果。"
