L["In Manage categories, copy or replace a category’s ordered condition identifiers. Named categories and Other are exclusive destinations. Switch membership is independent."] = "在“管理分类”中，复制或替换某个分类中按顺序排列的条件标识符。命名分类与“其他”是互斥的目标。“切换”成员资格是独立的。"
