-- en: "Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Cancel restores saved settings. Changing tabs or closing asks to apply pending changes; Cancel on the page discards them. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."
L["Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Cancel restores saved settings. Changing tabs or closing asks to apply pending changes; Cancel on the page discards them. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."] = "编辑内容会保留为草稿，直到点击“应用”。“取消”会恢复已保存的设置。切换标签页或关闭时会询问是否应用待处理的更改；页面上的“取消”会放弃这些更改。效果预览不会保存更改。动作条绑定操作是显式的，且立即生效。"
-- en: "Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; where the client has spell ranks, Use this exact spell rank limits matching to the rank you chose. Enabled toggles the announcement. New opens a draft with Apply and Cancel. Audible replaces text with sound selection and Play. Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the list; imports are validated and never execute code. Apply saves changes."
L["Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; where the client has spell ranks, Use this exact spell rank limits matching to the rank you chose. Enabled toggles the announcement. New opens a draft with Apply and Cancel. Audible replaces text with sound selection and Play. Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the list; imports are validated and never execute code. Apply saves changes."] = "展开一条通报以选择其动作、事件、频道和文本。法术字段会搜索法术目录；在有法术等级的客户端上，“使用这个确切的法术等级”会将匹配限制为你选择的等级。“已启用”用于开关该通报。“新建”会打开一个带有“应用”和“取消”的草稿。“声音”会以声音选择和“播放”取代文本。“复制”“导入/导出”和“比较”位于列表下方；导入内容会经过验证，且从不执行代码。“应用”会保存更改。"
