L["Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and blocks navigation until corrected. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."] = "按 Enter 或离开文本字段即可暂存其值；“应用”会保存草稿。无效文本会保持红色，并在更正前阻止页面切换。可搜索的选择器在点击时打开，并随输入进行筛选。分节标题可折叠或展开其内容。"
