-- en: "Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."
L["Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."] = "切换标签页时，每个回调都会保留各自待处理的文本。撤销和重做编辑的是该回调的缓冲区。“重置”会恢复其上次保存的代码（或新条件的模板），且可以撤销。主“应用”按钮会保存并注册所有回调缓冲区和元数据；“放弃”会丢弃整个草稿。有更改时离开会提供“应用”“放弃”或“取消”。“检查语法”不运行任何回调。"
