-- en: "Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "“字段界面”和“帮助”提供当前回调的显式“预览”。预览使用独立的示例值以及正常的字段或帮助渲染器。它不会保存、注册、验证或评估条件。关闭后会释放其控件并返回源码草稿。“检查语法”从不运行回调。"
-- en: "Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."
L["Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."] = "“评估”和“验证”提供“检查”，使用相同的字段界面和独立的示例值。“检查”会先进行验证，然后只评估有效的值。结果显示为真、假或不可用的原因。“实时”需手动开启，在此面板显示期间每秒最多检查两次；关闭面板即停止。测试值单独保存，永远不会进入条件导出或循环编辑。除非你再次检查或启用“实时”，否则源码更改不会运行任何回调。"
-- en: "Functions reference"
L["Functions reference"] = "函数参考"
-- en: "The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."
L["The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."] = "“函数”页面记录了公共辅助函数及其带类型的参数、返回值和源码。上下文补全和悬停提示会使用这些参考；按住 Ctrl 点击已知的辅助函数可打开其源码。对可复用的自定义辅助函数，请使用显式的绑定别名。"
