-- en: "Specialization"
L["Specialization"] = "专精"
-- en: "1 of the spells Blizzard can suggest isn't on your action bars, so the card skips it."
L["1 of the spells Blizzard can suggest isn't on your action bars, so the card skips it."] = "暴雪可能建议的法术中有 1 个不在你的动作条上，因此该卡片会跳过它。"
-- en: "%d of the spells Blizzard can suggest aren't on your action bars, so the card skips them."
