-- en: "Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."
L["Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."] = "执行旧版的整数或规范数字字符串拼写测试。数字使用向下取整后的相等比较；字符串必须等于经数字转换并向下取整后得到的拼写。其他类型返回 false。这不是有限数字的验证器。"
