L["On probe- and restricted-policy clients, observe exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitGUID(unit) only for a present unit. Known absence is false. Present identity requires a readable nonempty GUID; missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts are unavailable. No health, provider or extra-unit observation is added."] = "在探测或受限策略客户端上观测确切的 UnitExists(unit)，然后仅对存在的单位观测 UnitGUID(unit)。已知不存在时为 false。存在的身份要求可读的非空 GUID；所需信息缺失、失败、格式错误或受限时为不可用。不会添加生命值、提供者或额外单位的观测。"
