-- en: "Read a fresh protected UnitClass player observation for rotation ownership. Consume only the readable nonempty class filename from return two. No existence, level, vehicle, family or combat-policy read is added, and no result persists across calls. Core ownership still validates the class token and character key separately; overridden context providers retain their complete original path."
L["Read a fresh protected UnitClass player observation for rotation ownership. Consume only the readable nonempty class filename from return two. No existence, level, vehicle, family or combat-policy read is added, and no result persists across calls. Core ownership still validates the class token and character key separately; overridden context providers retain their complete original path."] = "为循环所有权读取一次全新的受保护 UnitClass 玩家观测。只使用第二个返回值中可读的非空职业文件名。不会添加存在性、等级、载具、客户端系列或战斗策略的读取，结果也不会跨调用保留。核心所有权仍会分别验证职业标识和角色键；被覆盖的上下文提供者保留其完整的原有路径。"
-- en: "Read a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for rune cooldown arithmetic. Require a readable finite number. This observation is deliberately uncached; callers preserve the original clock-before-scan order and require its value only when a matching rune needs timing. No evaluation-start substitution or inferred time is supplied."
L["Read a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for rune cooldown arithmetic. Require a readable finite number. This observation is deliberately uncached; callers preserve the original clock-before-scan order and require its value only when a matching rune needs timing. No evaluation-start substitution or inferred time is supplied."] = "为符文冷却运算读取一次全新的受保护无参数 GetTime。要求结果可读且为有限数字。此观测刻意不缓存；调用方保留原有的“先读时钟再扫描”顺序，并且只在有匹配的符文需要计时时才要求其值。不会以评估开始时间替代或推断时间。"
-- en: "Read a lazy health scalar after a separate identity gate. Kind current uses exact UnitHealth(unit); maximum uses exact UnitHealthMax(unit). Probe- and restricted-policy clients accept readable finite nonnegative numbers including zero. No repeated existence/GUID call or alternate tuple fallback is added."
L["Read a lazy health scalar after a separate identity gate. Kind current uses exact UnitHealth(unit); maximum uses exact UnitHealthMax(unit). Probe- and restricted-policy clients accept readable finite nonnegative numbers including zero. No repeated existence/GUID call or alternate tuple fallback is added."] = "在单独的身份检查之后读取惰性的生命值标量。current 种类使用确切的 UnitHealth(unit)；maximum 使用确切的 UnitHealthMax(unit)。探测或受限策略客户端接受可读的有限非负数字（包括零）。不会重复调用存在性/GUID 查询，也不会回退到其他元组。"
-- en: "Read a normalized charge record: currentCharges, maxCharges, cooldownStartTime, cooldownDuration, chargeModRate and isActive. Unsupported spells or restricted client data return nil with a reason."
L["Read a normalized charge record: currentCharges, maxCharges, cooldownStartTime, cooldownDuration, chargeModRate and isActive. Unsupported spells or restricted client data return nil with a reason."] = "读取规范化的充能记录：currentCharges、maxCharges、cooldownStartTime、cooldownDuration、chargeModRate 和 isActive。不受支持的法术或受限的客户端数据会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read a specified unit membership in the player party or raid. True raidOnly queries only UnitInRaid; otherwise a true UnitInParty result short-circuits, false proceeds to UnitInRaid, and unknown remains unavailable. Readable nil raid index means false; integer raid index1..40 means true. Names are passed unchanged to native APIs; native name-query acceptance requires client qualification."
L["Read a specified unit membership in the player party or raid. True raidOnly queries only UnitInRaid; otherwise a true UnitInParty result short-circuits, false proceeds to UnitInRaid, and unknown remains unavailable. Readable nil raid index means false; integer raid index1..40 means true. Names are passed unchanged to native APIs; native name-query acceptance requires client qualification."] = "读取指定单位是否属于玩家的小队或团队。raidOnly 为 true 时只查询 UnitInRaid；否则 UnitInParty 结果为 true 时直接返回，为 false 时继续查询 UnitInRaid，未知时保持为不可用。可读的 nil 团队索引表示 false；整数团队索引 1..40 表示 true。名称会原样传给原生 API；原生 API 是否接受名称查询需视客户端而定。"
-- en: "Read and normalize a spell cooldown across supported clients. The returned record contains startTime, duration, isEnabled and modRate. The timestamps and duration already describe expiration in GetTime() seconds; do not divide them by modRate. When the client hides the times (Retail and Forever in combat) the record is nil with reason restricted-value, followed by the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags when they can be read."
L["Read and normalize a spell cooldown across supported clients. The returned record contains startTime, duration, isEnabled and modRate. The timestamps and duration already describe expiration in GetTime() seconds; do not divide them by modRate. When the client hides the times (Retail and Forever in combat) the record is nil with reason restricted-value, followed by the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags when they can be read."] = "读取各受支持客户端的法术冷却并将其规范化。返回的记录包含 startTime、duration、isEnabled 和 modRate。时间戳和持续时间已经以 GetTime() 秒数描述到期时间；不要再除以 modRate。当客户端隐藏时间时（正式服和永久服的战斗中），记录为 nil，原因为 restricted-value，在可以读取时其后会附上永不为机密的 isEnabled、isActive 和 isOnGCD 标志。"
-- en: "Read normalized native item classification metadata. The record contains canonical itemID, classID and subClassID, plus equipLoc, the non-localized INVTYPE_* equip location token, when it is readable and nonempty; it does not require loaded item display text. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted metadata returns nil with a reason."
L["Read normalized native item classification metadata. The record contains canonical itemID, classID and subClassID, plus equipLoc, the non-localized INVTYPE_* equip location token, when it is readable and nonempty; it does not require loaded item display text. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted metadata returns nil with a reason."] = "读取规范化的原生物品分类元数据。记录包含规范的 itemID、classID 和 subClassID，以及在可读且非空时的 equipLoc（未本地化的 INVTYPE_* 装备位置标记）；不要求物品显示文本已加载。元数据缺失、失败、格式错误或受限时返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read one documented active loss-of-control row by its native index and requested subject kind. Type queries require only the readable control type string; school queries require only the readable finite nonnegative integer school mask. Optional timing is returned as a finite timeRemaining or an explicit per-field reason, so an unrelated subject does not require a usable timer. Missing rows are unavailable snapshot observations. No display fields, inferred deadline, duration sum, maximum or native alias fallback is used."
L["Read one documented active loss-of-control row by its native index and requested subject kind. Type queries require only the readable control type string; school queries require only the readable finite nonnegative integer school mask. Optional timing is returned as a finite timeRemaining or an explicit per-field reason, so an unrelated subject does not require a usable timer. Missing rows are unavailable snapshot observations. No display fields, inferred deadline, duration sum, maximum or native alias fallback is used."] = "按原生索引和所请求的主题种类，读取一条有文档的活跃失控记录行。type 查询只需要可读的控制类型字符串；school 查询只需要可读的有限非负整数法术类型掩码。可选的计时以有限的 timeRemaining 或逐字段的显式原因返回，因此不相关的主题不需要可用的计时器。缺失的行是不可用的快照观测。不会使用显示字段、推断的截止时间、持续时间总和、最大值或原生别名回退。"
-- en: "Read one explicitly selected point-resource quantity with an exact two-argument UnitPower or UnitPowerMax query. The selector is required; no primary-resource inference or actor remapping occurs. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero quantities without clamping. Missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. Current and maximum are separate observations so callers can share current snapshots while requesting maximum lazily."
L["Read one explicitly selected point-resource quantity with an exact two-argument UnitPower or UnitPowerMax query. The selector is required; no primary-resource inference or actor remapping occurs. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero quantities without clamping. Missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. Current and maximum are separate observations so callers can share current snapshots while requesting maximum lazily."] = "使用确切的双参数 UnitPower 或 UnitPowerMax 查询，读取一个显式选择的点数资源数量。选择器为必需；不会推断主要资源或重新映射角色。保留有限的带符号、小数和零数量，不进行截断。缺失、失败、受限或非有限的数据保持为不可用。当前值和最大值是分开的观测，因此调用方可以共享当前值快照，同时按需延迟请求最大值。"
-- en: "Read one protected GetRuneCooldown tuple for an exact native slot. Normalize ready, start and duration independently: ready requires a readable Boolean, while each time requires a readable finite number and preserves signed, fractional and zero values. Every unavailable field carries its own reason. A successful empty tuple yields a partial record; missing capability, policy or native-call failure yields nil. Never infer ready from timing or timing from ready. Cache this complete record at the caller to share one observation between rune-count and cooldown predicates."
L["Read one protected GetRuneCooldown tuple for an exact native slot. Normalize ready, start and duration independently: ready requires a readable Boolean, while each time requires a readable finite number and preserves signed, fractional and zero values. Every unavailable field carries its own reason. A successful empty tuple yields a partial record; missing capability, policy or native-call failure yields nil. Never infer ready from timing or timing from ready. Cache this complete record at the caller to share one observation between rune-count and cooldown predicates."] = "为一个确切的原生栏位读取一次受保护的 GetRuneCooldown 元组。分别规范化 ready、start 和 duration：ready 需要可读的布尔值，而每个时间值需要可读的有限数字，并保留带符号、小数和零值。每个不可用的字段都附带其自己的原因。成功返回空元组时会产生部分记录；缺少能力、策略或原生调用失败时返回 nil。绝不从计时推断 ready，也不从 ready 推断计时。请在调用方缓存这份完整记录，以便在符文计数和冷却判断之间共享一次观测。"
-- en: "Read optional MobInfo2 historical observations on probe- and restricted-policy clients. Cache only exact selected-unit presence; UnitName result one, UnitLevel result one and the three-argument MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) dot call stay fresh each invocation. Known absent units and successful unrecorded nil or omitted history remain distinct from unavailable native/provider facts. Preserve readable runner scalar truthiness, school signs and missing-Hits default one. Positive resistance ratios must be finite; complete immunity consumes finite Hits while partial immunity needs only its negative school observation. Never infer native resistance or borrow old records."
L["Read optional MobInfo2 historical observations on probe- and restricted-policy clients. Cache only exact selected-unit presence; UnitName result one, UnitLevel result one and the three-argument MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) dot call stay fresh each invocation. Known absent units and successful unrecorded nil or omitted history remain distinct from unavailable native/provider facts. Preserve readable runner scalar truthiness, school signs and missing-Hits default one. Positive resistance ratios must be finite; complete immunity consumes finite Hits while partial immunity needs only its negative school observation. Never infer native resistance or borrow old records."] = "在探测或受限策略客户端上读取可选的 MobInfo2 历史观测。只缓存确切的所选单位存在性；UnitName 的第一个结果、UnitLevel 的第一个结果以及三参数的 MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) 点号调用每次都会重新获取。已知不存在的单位，以及成功返回的未记录的 nil 或省略的历史，与不可用的原生/提供者信息保持区分。保留可读的 runner 标量真值、法术类型符号以及缺少 Hits 时默认为一。正的抗性比例必须有限；完全免疫会使用有限的 Hits，而部分免疫只需要其负值的法术类型观测。绝不推断原生抗性或借用旧记录。"
-- en: "Read optional RealMobHealth using its exact one-argument dot call. Absent nil/false namespace returns an empty record. Normalize current and maximum independently: nil/false fields permit native fallback, numeric zero remains present. Malformed, failed, restricted, negative or nonfinite consumed provider facts are unavailable. No provider or stale fallback cache is used."
L["Read optional RealMobHealth using its exact one-argument dot call. Absent nil/false namespace returns an empty record. Normalize current and maximum independently: nil/false fields permit native fallback, numeric zero remains present. Malformed, failed, restricted, negative or nonfinite consumed provider facts are unavailable. No provider or stale fallback cache is used."] = "使用确切的单参数点号调用读取可选的 RealMobHealth。命名空间不存在（nil/false）时返回空记录。分别规范化当前值和最大值：nil/false 字段允许回退到原生值，数字零仍视为存在。所使用的提供者信息格式错误、失败、受限、为负或非有限时为不可用。不使用提供者或过期的后备缓存。"
-- en: "Read public group membership on identified client families. Unknown clients are unsupported. True raidOnly checks IsInRaid; false or nil checks IsInGroup using its native default group category. A readable false result stays false. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read public group membership on identified client families. Unknown clients are unsupported. True raidOnly checks IsInRaid; false or nil checks IsInGroup using its native default group category. A readable false result stays false. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."] = "在已识别的客户端系列上读取公开的队伍成员身份。未知客户端不受支持。raidOnly 为 true 时检查 IsInRaid；为 false 或 nil 时使用原生默认的队伍类别检查 IsInGroup。可读的 false 结果保持为 false。缺失、失败、格式错误或受限的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read public roster identity on identified client families. Input routing is limited to player, party1 through party4 and raid1 through raid40. Call UnitExists with that exact one-argument token first; known false returns false without querying class. For a present unit, consume only UnitClass return two as a readable nonempty class filename string, without a class enum restriction. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts return nil with a reason."
L["Read public roster identity on identified client families. Input routing is limited to player, party1 through party4 and raid1 through raid40. Call UnitExists with that exact one-argument token first; known false returns false without querying class. For a present unit, consume only UnitClass return two as a readable nonempty class filename string, without a class enum restriction. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts return nil with a reason."] = "在已识别的客户端系列上读取公开的名单身份。输入路由仅限 player、party1 到 party4，以及 raid1 到 raid40。先以该确切的单参数标识调用 UnitExists；已知为 false 时直接返回 false，不查询职业。对于存在的单位，只使用 UnitClass 的第二个返回值作为可读的非空职业文件名字符串，不限制职业枚举。所需信息缺失、失败、格式错误或受限时返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read spell-specific range for a unit using the appropriate client API or spell-book slot. A spell without a range restriction returns applicable=false; otherwise applicable=true and inRange records whether the unit is in range. Unknown or inaccessible observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read spell-specific range for a unit using the appropriate client API or spell-book slot. A spell without a range restriction returns applicable=false; otherwise applicable=true and inRange records whether the unit is in range. Unknown or inaccessible observations return nil with a reason."] = "使用适当的客户端 API 或法术书栏位，读取某个单位针对特定法术的距离。没有距离限制的法术返回 applicable=false；否则 applicable=true，inRange 记录该单位是否在距离内。未知或无法访问的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read the current positive nameplate visibility distance using the supported CVar API. This limits a Distance Count query; it does not prove that all nearby units have been observed. Missing, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read the current positive nameplate visibility distance using the supported CVar API. This limits a Distance Count query; it does not prove that all nearby units have been observed. Missing, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."] = "使用受支持的 CVar API 读取当前正的姓名板可见距离。这会限制“距离内计数”查询；它不能证明所有附近的单位都已被观测到。缺失、格式错误、受限或失败的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read the documented active loss-of-control count with a protected zero-argument dot call. Require a readable finite nonnegative integer. Zero is a complete empty scan and does not require a row API. RM limits a scan to 256 rows and returns unavailable beyond that resource budget; this is not a declared native maximum. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable."
L["Read the documented active loss-of-control count with a protected zero-argument dot call. Require a readable finite nonnegative integer. Zero is a complete empty scan and does not require a row API. RM limits a scan to 256 rows and returns unavailable beyond that resource budget; this is not a declared native maximum. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable."] = "使用受保护的无参数点号调用，读取有文档的活跃失控数量。要求结果可读且为有限的非负整数。零表示一次完整的空扫描，不需要行 API。RM 将扫描限制为 256 行，超出该资源预算时返回不可用；这并不是原生声明的最大值。所需观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时保持为不可用。"
-- en: "Read the player auto-repeat state for a spell such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is distinct from a current or queued cast. Modern clients receive the exact spell ID; a legacy query resolves the player spell-book slot first. Restricted client policies, unreadable results and unavailable book slots return nil with a reason. This observes state and never starts or stops a spell."
L["Read the player auto-repeat state for a spell such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is distinct from a current or queued cast. Modern clients receive the exact spell ID; a legacy query resolves the player spell-book slot first. Restricted client policies, unreadable results and unavailable book slots return nil with a reason. This observes state and never starts or stops a spell."] = "读取玩家某个法术（例如射击或自动射击）的自动重复状态。这与当前或排队中的施法不同。现代客户端会收到确切的法术 ID；旧版查询会先解析玩家的法术书栏位。受限的客户端策略、无法读取的结果以及不可用的法术书栏位会返回 nil 及原因。这只观测状态，从不开始或停止法术。"
-- en: "Read the public LibRangeCheck interval for a unit. A successful upper bound is inclusive; a positive failed lower bound is strict. A zero lower floor is synthetic. Neither bound is an exact distance, and a missing upper bound is not proof that the unit is outside every radius. Unavailable, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read the public LibRangeCheck interval for a unit. A successful upper bound is inclusive; a positive failed lower bound is strict. A zero lower floor is synthetic. Neither bound is an exact distance, and a missing upper bound is not proof that the unit is outside every radius. Unavailable, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."] = "读取某个单位的公开 LibRangeCheck 距离区间。成功的上限是包含的；正的失败下限是严格的。零下限是合成的。两个边界都不是精确距离，缺少上限也不能证明该单位在所有半径之外。不可用、格式错误、受限或失败的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Readability authority for consumed values."
L["Readability authority for consumed values."] = "所使用值的可读性判定依据。"
-- en: "Readable canonical item classification record (itemID, classID, subClassID and optional equipLoc), or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable canonical item classification record (itemID, classID, subClassID and optional equipLoc), or nil when unavailable."] = "可读的规范物品分类记录（itemID、classID、subClassID 和可选的 equipLoc），不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable canonical itemID/classID/subClassID record when the item is a glyph for the requested class; nil for invalid or unavailable metadata."
L["Readable canonical itemID/classID/subClassID record when the item is a glyph for the requested class; nil for invalid or unavailable metadata."] = "当物品是所请求职业的雕文时，返回可读的规范 itemID/classID/subClassID 记录；元数据无效或不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable charge record, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable charge record, or nil when unavailable."] = "可读的充能记录；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable consumed metadata string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable consumed metadata string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可读的所使用元数据字符串；已知单位不存在时为 false，所需数据不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable cooldown record, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable cooldown record, or nil when unavailable."] = "可读的冷却记录；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable current state, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable current state, or nil when unavailable."] = "可读的当前状态；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable finite current-form observation, including zero for the current unshifted comparison; nil when unavailable."
L["Readable finite current-form observation, including zero for the current unshifted comparison; nil when unavailable."] = "可读的有限当前形态观测，包括与当前未变形状态比较时的零；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable finite positive integral rune type, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable finite positive integral rune type, or nil when unavailable."] = "可读的有限正整数符文类型；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable interval with optional minimum and maximum bounds in yards. At least one bound is present; nil when unavailable."
L["Readable interval with optional minimum and maximum bounds in yards. At least one bound is present; nil when unavailable."] = "可读的区间，带有可选的最小和最大边界（码）。至少存在一个边界；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty selected unit token, passed unchanged as the single argument to existence and creature metadata queries."
L["Readable nonempty selected unit token, passed unchanged as the single argument to existence and creature metadata queries."] = "可读的非空所选单位标识，作为单个参数原样传给存在性和生物元数据查询。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token or native-recognized name, passed unchanged."
L["Readable nonempty unit token or native-recognized name, passed unchanged."] = "可读的非空单位标识或原生可识别的名称，原样传递。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token to match, unchanged in the native observation."
L["Readable nonempty unit token to match, unchanged in the native observation."] = "要匹配的可读非空单位标识，在原生观测中保持不变。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token, passed unchanged as the single native argument."
L["Readable nonempty unit token, passed unchanged as the single native argument."] = "可读的非空单位标识，作为单个原生参数原样传递。"
-- en: "Readable record with Boolean exists and the requested class filename when present; nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable record with Boolean exists and the requested class filename when present; nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可读记录，包含布尔值 exists，存在时还包含所请求的职业文件名；所需数据不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable selected flag or nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable selected flag or nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可读的所选标记；所需数据不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable selected flag, false for a known absent unit, or nil when a required observation is unavailable."
L["Readable selected flag, false for a known absent unit, or nil when a required observation is unavailable."] = "可读的所选标记；已知单位不存在时为 false，所需观测不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Readable unit equality, false for a known absent first unit, or nil when required observations are unavailable."
L["Readable unit equality, false for a known absent first unit, or nil when required observations are unavailable."] = "可读的单位相等结果；已知第一个单位不存在时为 false，所需观测不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Record with exists=false, or exists=true and finite value; nil when unavailable."
L["Record with exists=false, or exists=true and finite value; nil when unavailable."] = "记录为 exists=false，或 exists=true 并带有有限的 value；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Record with exists=false; recorded=false for known no history; or runner, ratio, or immune with hits/hitsReason. Nil means a required observation is unavailable."
L["Record with exists=false; recorded=false for known no history; or runner, ratio, or immune with hits/hitsReason. Nil means a required observation is unavailable."] = "记录为 exists=false；已知没有历史时为 recorded=false；或者为 runner、ratio 或 immune，并带有 hits/hitsReason。nil 表示所需观测不可用。"
-- en: "Record with inInstance and, when inside, instanceType or instanceTypeReason; nil when membership is unavailable."
L["Record with inInstance and, when inside, instanceType or instanceTypeReason; nil when membership is unavailable."] = "记录包含 inInstance，在副本内时还包含 instanceType 或 instanceTypeReason；成员值不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Reference input kind, such as Spec_EditBox, used for spell suggestions."
L["Reference input kind, such as Spec_EditBox, used for spell suggestions."] = "用于法术建议的引用输入种类，例如 Spec_EditBox。"
-- en: "Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."
L["Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."] = "原地移除条目，默认只保留 except 值中列出的键。invert 为 true 时，移除列出的键并保留未列出的键。没有例外列表时，默认会移除所有条目，而 invert 为 true 时会保留所有条目。输入为 nil 时不执行任何操作。"
-- en: "Remove leading and trailing Lua-pattern whitespace from a string."
L["Remove leading and trailing Lua-pattern whitespace from a string."] = "移除字符串开头和结尾符合 Lua 模式的空白字符。"
-- en: "Resolve a readable raw unit level for condition evaluation. Known absence returns false; unavailable observations return nil with a reason. Cache observations within the supplied evaluation pass. Only valid player levels are retained between passes until a skill, profile or level refresh."
L["Resolve a readable raw unit level for condition evaluation. Known absence returns false; unavailable observations return nil with a reason. Cache observations within the supplied evaluation pass. Only valid player levels are retained between passes until a skill, profile or level refresh."] = "为条件评估解析可读的原始单位等级。已知不存在时返回 false；观测不可用时返回 nil 及原因。在所提供的评估轮次内缓存观测。只有有效的玩家等级会在轮次之间保留，直到技能、配置文件或等级刷新。"
-- en: "Resolve an exact cast-recipient name against the current bounded party or raid roster, then observe membership through a unit token. Missing, ambiguous or changing roster data remains unavailable; never reads the selected target or retains state across casts."
L["Resolve an exact cast-recipient name against the current bounded party or raid roster, then observe membership through a unit token. Missing, ambiguous or changing roster data remains unavailable; never reads the selected target or retains state across casts."] = "将确切的施法对象名称与当前有限的小队或团队名单进行匹配，然后通过单位标识观测其成员身份。名单数据缺失、含义不明确或正在变化时保持为不可用；绝不读取所选目标，也不在施法之间保留状态。"
-- en: "Resolve point resources using the original live class mapping and identity cache, with an explicit TBC player ComboPoints-fallback transport policy. A player fallback matching the readable raw Enum.PowerType table and ComboPoints value captured at module load selects target-combo; explicit class-map entries, other actors and other families retain power. Replaced, inherited or unprovable fallback provenance retains power. This versioned policy does not claim native UnitPower is broken or equivalent. Known unit absence returns false; unavailable required observations return nil with a reason. No current or maximum quantity is queried here."
L["Resolve point resources using the original live class mapping and identity cache, with an explicit TBC player ComboPoints-fallback transport policy. A player fallback matching the readable raw Enum.PowerType table and ComboPoints value captured at module load selects target-combo; explicit class-map entries, other actors and other families retain power. Replaced, inherited or unprovable fallback provenance retains power. This versioned policy does not claim native UnitPower is broken or equivalent. Known unit absence returns false; unavailable required observations return nil with a reason. No current or maximum quantity is queried here."] = "使用原有的实时职业映射和身份缓存解析点数资源，并采用显式的 TBC 玩家 ComboPoints 后备传输策略。若玩家后备与模块加载时捕获的可读原始 Enum.PowerType 表和 ComboPoints 值相符，则选择 target-combo；显式的职业映射条目、其他角色和其他客户端系列保留 power。被替换、继承或无法证明来源的后备保留 power。此带版本的策略并不声称原生 UnitPower 有问题或与之等效。已知单位不存在时返回 false；所需观测不可用时返回 nil 及原因。此处不查询当前值或最大值。"
-- en: "Resolve the selected unit point-resource selector using the live class-to-resource map and ComboPoints fallback. Known absence returns false; unavailable required identity or selector data returns nil with a reason. Share complete identity observations within the evaluation pass. Only successful player class observations persist in the current longterm cache, tied to the native UnitClass identity; existence is refreshed each pass. This selects a resource without reading its current or maximum quantity."
L["Resolve the selected unit point-resource selector using the live class-to-resource map and ComboPoints fallback. Known absence returns false; unavailable required identity or selector data returns nil with a reason. Share complete identity observations within the evaluation pass. Only successful player class observations persist in the current longterm cache, tied to the native UnitClass identity; existence is refreshed each pass. This selects a resource without reading its current or maximum quantity."] = "使用实时的职业到资源映射和 ComboPoints 后备，解析所选单位的点数资源选择器。已知不存在时返回 false；所需的身份或选择器数据不可用时返回 nil 及原因。在评估轮次内共享完整的身份观测。只有成功的玩家职业观测会保留在当前的长期缓存中，并与原生 UnitClass 身份绑定；存在性在每个轮次都会刷新。这只选择资源，不读取其当前值或最大值。"
-- en: "Resolve the spell identifier stored by a condition. With exact rank enabled the supplied ID is retained; otherwise ranked Classic clients resolve the currently known rank through the spell catalog. Returns nil and an availability reason if resolution cannot be completed."
L["Resolve the spell identifier stored by a condition. With exact rank enabled the supplied ID is retained; otherwise ranked Classic clients resolve the currently known rank through the spell catalog. Returns nil and an availability reason if resolution cannot be completed."] = "解析条件中存储的法术标识符。启用精确等级时会保留所提供的 ID；否则在有等级的经典版客户端上，会通过法术目录解析当前已知的等级。无法完成解析时返回 nil 和可用性原因。"
-- en: "Resolved spell ID, or nil when unavailable."
L["Resolved spell ID, or nil when unavailable."] = "解析后的法术 ID；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Resolver mapping a typed spell name to its ID."
L["Resolver mapping a typed spell name to its ID."] = "将输入的法术名称映射到其 ID 的解析器。"
-- en: "Return a present value unchanged, or a red display placeholder for nil. Use for readable condition labels, not as a boolean fallback."
L["Return a present value unchanged, or a red display placeholder for nil. Use for readable condition labels, not as a boolean fallback."] = "原样返回存在的值；为 nil 时返回红色的显示占位符。用于可读的条件标签，而不是作为布尔值的后备。"
-- en: "Return the first key whose value equals the supplied value during pairs traversal. Nil or false input tables and absent values return nil. Multiple matching keys have no guaranteed selection order."
L["Return the first key whose value equals the supplied value during pairs traversal. Nil or false input tables and absent values return nil. Multiple matching keys have no guaranteed selection order."] = "在 pairs 遍历过程中返回第一个值等于所提供值的键。输入表为 nil 或 false 以及值不存在时返回 nil。有多个匹配的键时，选择顺序不确定。"
-- en: "Right operand; DIVISIBLE requires a nonzero divisor."
L["Right operand; DIVISIBLE requires a nonzero divisor."] = "右操作数；DIVISIBLE 要求除数不为零。"
-- en: "Rotation Master addon instance (implicit with colon calls)."
L["Rotation Master addon instance (implicit with colon calls)."] = "Rotation Master 插件实例（使用冒号调用时隐含传入）。"
-- en: "Rotation Master platform adapter (implicit with colon calls)."
L["Rotation Master platform adapter (implicit with colon calls)."] = "Rotation Master 平台适配器（使用冒号调用时隐含传入）。"
-- en: "Rotation Master platform adapter. A dot reference requires addon.Platform as the first argument; a colon call supplies it implicitly."
L["Rotation Master platform adapter. A dot reference requires addon.Platform as the first argument; a colon call supplies it implicitly."] = "Rotation Master 平台适配器。点号引用需要将 addon.Platform 作为第一个参数；冒号调用会隐含提供它。"
-- en: "Round with the existing floor(num * 10^places + 0.5) / 10^places formula. Places defaults to zero and may be negative. Halfway negative values round toward positive infinity; no finite-number validation or alternative rounding policy is added."
L["Round with the existing floor(num * 10^places + 0.5) / 10^places formula. Places defaults to zero and may be negative. Halfway negative values round toward positive infinity; no finite-number validation or alternative rounding policy is added."] = "使用现有的 floor(num * 10^places + 0.5) / 10^places 公式进行舍入。places 默认为零，可以为负。处于一半的负值会向正无穷方向舍入；不会添加有限数字验证或其他舍入策略。"
-- en: "Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. An empty array, or snapshots that record no weighted change, return only zero rather than a 0/0 result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."
L["Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. An empty array, or snapshots that record no weighted change, return only zero rather than a 0/0 result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."] = "使用实时配置文件的历史窗口、时钟和旧版舍入服务，运行历史生命值快照的趋势公式。保留其最大生命值的过渡、在满血或零血时提前停止、加权、错误和返回值数量。空数组或未记录任何加权变化的快照只返回零，而不是 0/0 的结果；这是旧版算法，而不是经过验证的预测。"
-- en: "Second exact unit token, passed unchanged to UnitIsUnit."
L["Second exact unit token, passed unchanged to UnitIsUnit."] = "第二个确切的单位标识，原样传给 UnitIsUnit。"
-- en: "Second table to compare."
L["Second table to compare."] = "要比较的第二个表。"
-- en: "Selected nonempty unit token, unchanged in native calls."
L["Selected nonempty unit token, unchanged in native calls."] = "所选的非空单位标识，在原生调用中保持不变。"
-- en: "Selected nonempty unit token, unchanged in native/provider calls."
L["Selected nonempty unit token, unchanged in native/provider calls."] = "所选的非空单位标识，在原生/提供者调用中保持不变。"
-- en: "Selected nonempty unit token."
L["Selected nonempty unit token."] = "所选的非空单位标识。"
-- en: "Selected nonempty unit token; this call alone does not establish presence."
L["Selected nonempty unit token; this call alone does not establish presence."] = "所选的非空单位标识；仅凭此调用不能确定其存在。"
-- en: "Selected nonempty unit token; unchanged native argument."
L["Selected nonempty unit token; unchanged native argument."] = "所选的非空单位标识；作为原生参数保持不变。"
